429
00:19:19,526 --> 00:19:21,256
A couple years ago,
Sam moved away,

430
00:19:21,361 --> 00:19:22,901
and I just really miss her.

431
00:19:22,995 --> 00:19:25,825
But whenever I'm
inside Vin Diesel, I...

